    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Accelerating Large-Scale Reasoning Model Inference with Sparse Self-Speculative <span class="search-hit mathjax">Decoding</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhao%2C+Y">Yilong Zhao</a>, 
      
