    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Chain of Unit-Physics: A Primitive-Centric Approach to Scientific Code Synthesis
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sharma%2C+V">Vansh Sharma</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Raman%2C+V">Venkat Raman</a>
      
