        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2512.00453">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2512.00453">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2512.00453">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
